# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
**/out/*
**/.env
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Host runtime content (the host is a checkout of this repo; these live
# alongside it untracked and must survive `git reset --hard`)
/data/

# Generated favicon sets (make icons). Explicitly un-ignored: the common macOS
# global-gitignore rule for Finder's custom folder icon is written `Icon?`, and
# `?` is a single-character wildcard, so it matches the directory name `icons`
# in any path. Without this the generated tiles are silently uncommittable —
# `make icons` looks fine, then every icon route 404s on the host, which
# deploys by `git reset --hard`. Un-ignoring the directory is what matters:
# git will not descend into an excluded directory to re-include files under it.
!caddy/icons/
